    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "mushroom that springs up in the morning and withers by night",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「わぁ、こんなところに朝菌が生えてる！」と子供が指差した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "夕方には萎れてしまう朝菌の儚さが、詩人にインスピレーションを与えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この森では、雨上がりの翌朝にだけ珍しい朝菌を見ることができる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "大椿の寿も、朝菌の夭も、長さに変わりはないのじゃ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "悟浄出世",
                "author": "中島敦",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
